# Python — CodeProject1

- Use `src/lotto/` package; run as `python -m lotto.cli`.
- Type hints on public functions; dataclasses in `models.py`.
- Tests in `tests/` with `pytest`; name files `test_*.py`.
- Cache draw data under `data/` (gitignored); do not commit large JSON unless sample fixture.
- External fetch logic stays in `fetch.py`; analysis pure in `analyze.py`.
